stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Scratch 
    Scratch --> Candidate: training completed 
    Candidate --> Challenger: validation passed 
    Candidate --> Rejected: validation failed 
    Challenger --> Staging: promotion approved 
    Challenger --> Rejected: rejected 
    Staging --> Production: deployment successful 
    Staging --> Rejected: failed validation 
    Production --> Champion: selected best model 
    Production --> Retired: replaced 
    Champion --> Retired: superseded 
    Retired --> [*] 
    Rejected --> [*]